      "kind": "interpretation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "立秋提示收获的开始，也提示衰减的必然——中国美学中的\"悲秋\"由此而起。",
        "en": "Liqiu signals both harvest and inevitable decline — the root of Chinese autumn melancholy."
      },
